{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey with Galactic Conquest Universe, the pioneering real-time strategy game that redefines the genre with live voxel terrain deformation. Watch as landscapes shift under the fire of your weapons\u2014reshaping tactics on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command one of six distinct factions, each with unique units, buildings, and playstyles. Master your economy via a comprehensive marketplace where healthy trade can fuel your war machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed in Unity with a charming low\u2011poly aesthetic, Galactic Conquest Universe balances approachable visuals with deep, dynamic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your battlefield: intense PvP 1\u2011on\u20111 matches on compact maps, or test your endurance in survival mode\u2014now to level 15, with limitless future rounds, boss waves, and new biomes on the roadmap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With continuous post-launch support\u2014adding maps, factions, UI enhancements, and more\u2014your battlefield will evolve long after launch. Add to your wishlist and get ready to lead your faction through a shifting warzone.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3350350?t=1754681678","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3350350?t=1754681678","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350350/98279ae27fb519428f9cfd1caed973794a0b22bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754681678","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350350/98279ae27fb519428f9cfd1caed973794a0b22bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754681678","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{